<InfoPage title="Privacy Policy" kicker="Privacy" description="How SpicyBox Guide handles visits and personal information on this static independent publication."><h2>Summary</h2><p>This is a static editorial website. It has no accounts, prompts, image uploader, AI generator, subscription checkout, or visitor profile database.</p><h2>Technical request data</h2><p>Our hosting and security provider may process standard request information such as IP address, browser type, URL, timestamp, and security signals to deliver and protect the site.</p><h2>No image collection</h2><p>We do not accept or store SpicyBox credentials, source photos, generated media, payment details, or intimate images. Never post sensitive information in a public issue tracker.</p><h2>External services</h2><p>Official product and reference links lead to third-party sites governed by their own policies. Read them before registering, uploading an image, generating output, or paying.</p></InfoPage>
